abstract: >
  Herbivora is a desktop GUI for leaf herbivory quantification from photographs,
  combining BiRefNet + MobileSAM segmentation, UNET Shape contour reconstruction,
  and a damage U-Net with interactive editing tools.
keywords:
  - herbivory
  - leaf damage
  - computer vision
